  "avisoContenido": "This game contains frequent depictions of intense violence, blood, and gore. During combat against humanoid enemies, players may see dismemberment effects and exaggerated damage visuals. The game also includes visual elements that some players may find disturbing or frightening, such as corpses, grotesque enemy designs, humanoid creatures with decayed appearances, and unsettling environmental imagery. Certain parts of the story and presentation reference themes of death and self-harm. In some scenes where decayed humanoid enemy characters are introduced, there are depictions suggesting falling from heights or hanging. These portrayals are used to emphasize the unnatural nature of the enemies and the game’s dark world, and are not interactive acts performed by the player. However, these themes may be sensitive for some audiences. The game contains mild suggestive themes and occasional character designs or visual framing that may imply sexuality, but there are no explicit sexual acts or nudity. The overall tone is dark and violent, featuring grotesque imagery consistent with a mature-rated action title.",
